# Package Manager: pnpm Only

This is a pnpm monorepo (`pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`). Always use **pnpm** — never npm, yarn, bun, or npx.

## Commands

| Instead of          | Use                                    |
| ------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `npm install`       | `pnpm install`                         |
| `npm add <pkg>`     | `pnpm add <pkg>`                       |
| `npm run <script>`  | `pnpm run <script>` or `pnpm <script>` |
| `npx <cmd>`         | `pnpm dlx <cmd>`                       |
| `yarn` / `yarn add` | `pnpm` / `pnpm add`                    |

## Monorepo

- Run scripts in a workspace package: `pnpm --filter <package> <script>`
- Run across all packages: `pnpm -r run <script>`

## Examples

```bash
# ❌ BAD
npm install
npx create-vite@latest
npm run dev

# ✅ GOOD
pnpm install
pnpm dlx create-vite@latest
pnpm dev
```
